    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They don\u2019t run. But you do.</strong><br>You leap through fractured minds, shaped by rage, sorrow, or silence. Each level is a soul, trapped in memory.<br>You're not just passing through; you\u2019re breaking chains. Maybe your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harder Parkour</strong> is a physics-based platformer wrapped in a spiritual journey.<br>You collect light, unlock cages, and awaken what was forgotten.<br>The world breathes with each soul, fog, ruins, frozen time.<br>Music shifts. Light trembles.<br>And something inside... waits for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/977e3a5f12c1e5d0402c713f8dcf527e.poster.avif?t=1750691170\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/977e3a5f12c1e5d0402c713f8dcf527e.webm?t=1750691170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Precision Parkour, Pure Physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No powers. No shortcuts. Only real, weighty, momentum-based movement that punishes hesitation and rewards mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/d8a6aa77ed749306b05890fcdc66b76e.poster.avif?t=1750691170\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/d8a6aa77ed749306b05890fcdc66b76e.webm?t=1750691170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blood Is the Price of Passage </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miscalculations have consequences. Falls leave marks. Every mistake is visceral, blood, and impact. You won\u2019t just feel failure. You\u2019ll see it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/c81307d1eb041a7523dd9fd1c1afa7b4.poster.avif?t=1750691170\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/c81307d1eb041a7523dd9fd1c1afa7b4.webm?t=1750691170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Soul Shapes Its Level</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage reflects the inner world of a trapped soul, formed by rage, grief, silence, or longing. The architecture, the light, the tension; all echo the soul\u2019s personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/3470f8a164f1f2cc18d2a1991a65661b.poster.avif?t=1750691170\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/3470f8a164f1f2cc18d2a1991a65661b.webm?t=1750691170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>A Labyrinth of Minds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not just moving through space; you\u2019re navigating memories, traumas, and forgotten thoughts. Every level is a mental maze where the challenge is both physical and emotional. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/a10b4333f81cf913d82b4b7cbcc7116b.poster.avif?t=1750691170\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/a10b4333f81cf913d82b4b7cbcc7116b.webm?t=1750691170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Free the Souls, Open the Way </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Gather light. Unlock the cage. Open spiritual portals that carry you from one haunted mind to the next. This isn\u2019t just progress, it\u2019s liberation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/8da5b1b289f51afaee017db383e047d1.poster.avif?t=1750691170\" width=200 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/8da5b1b289f51afaee017db383e047d1.webm?t=1750691170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/8da5b1b289f51afaee017db383e047d1.mp4?t=1750691170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harder Parkour is now on Steam!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curious? Add it to your <strong>wishlist</strong> and get ready to jump in when the time comes.</p>",
