ideo class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/a10b4333f81cf913d82b4b7cbcc7116b.poster.avif?t=1750691170\" width=618 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/a10b4333f81cf913d82b4b7cbcc7116b.webm?t=1750691170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Free the Souls, Open the Way </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Gather light. Unlock the cage. Open spiritual portals that carry you from one haunted mind to the next. This isn\u2019t just progress, it\u2019s liberation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/8da5b1b289f51afaee017db383e047d1.poster.avif?t=1750691170\" width=200 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/8da5b1b289f51afaee017db383e047d1.webm?t=1750691170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740800/extras/8da5b1b289f51afaee017db383e047d1.mp4?t=1750691170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harder Parkour is now on Steam!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Curious? Add it to your <strong>wishlist</strong> and get ready to jump in when the time comes.</p>",
